{"id":"bcbbb5818d2f6100","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-johnson-homomorphism.md","title":"Johnson Homomorphism","display":"df-johnson-homomorphism — Johnson Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-johnson-homomorphism","aliases":["58-df-johnson-homomorphism"],"display":"df-johnson-homomorphism — Johnson Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-johnson-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-johnson-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-johnson-homomorphism — Johnson Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" href=\"?note=c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md\">../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb2bd3bd0214732\" href=\"?note=1eb2bd3bd0214732\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md\">../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"12045dd8fa450631\" href=\"?note=12045dd8fa450631\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\omega\\land\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0,J,\\cdot_\\pi\\in V\\land x_0\\in\\partial\\Sigma_{g,1}\">\\(g\\in\\omega\\land\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0,J,\\cdot_\\pi\\in V\\land x_0\\in\\partial\\Sigma_{g,1}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1:V^3\\to V\">\\(\\pi_1:V^3\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" href=\"?note=c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md\">../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1eb2bd3bd0214732\" href=\"?note=1eb2bd3bd0214732\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md\">../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}:V\\to V\">\\(\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"12045dd8fa450631\" href=\"?note=12045dd8fa450631\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JohnsonHom}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{JohnsonHom}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}johnson\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{JohnsonHom}_S(J,\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0,\\cdot_\\pi)\\leftrightarrow g\\geq2\\land x_0\\in\\partial\\Sigma_{g,1}\\land\\exists\\pi,H,\\Gamma_2,\\Gamma_3,\\mathcal I,\\vartheta\\;\\left(\\pi=\\pi_1(\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(\\pi,\\cdot_\\pi)\\land\\Gamma_2=[\\pi,\\pi]\\land\\Gamma_3=[\\pi,\\Gamma_2]\\land H=\\pi/\\Gamma_2\\land\\vartheta:\\Gamma_2/\\Gamma_3\\xrightarrow{\\cong}\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}H\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{\\phi\\in\\pi^\\pi:\\mathrm{Aut}_S(\\phi,\\pi,\\cdot_\\pi)\\land\\forall x\\in\\pi\\;\\phi(x)\\Gamma_2=x\\Gamma_2\\right\\}\\land J\\in\\operatorname{Hom}\\!\\left(\\mathcal I,\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbb Z}\\!\\left(H,\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}H\\right)\\right)\\land\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall x\\in\\pi\\;J(\\phi)(x\\Gamma_2)=\\vartheta\\!\\left((\\phi(x)x^{-1})\\Gamma_3\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}johnson\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{JohnsonHom}_S(J,\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0,\\cdot_\\pi)\\leftrightarrow g\\geq2\\land x_0\\in\\partial\\Sigma_{g,1}\\land\\exists\\pi,H,\\Gamma_2,\\Gamma_3,\\mathcal I,\\vartheta\\;\\left(\\pi=\\pi_1(\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(\\pi,\\cdot_\\pi)\\land\\Gamma_2=[\\pi,\\pi]\\land\\Gamma_3=[\\pi,\\Gamma_2]\\land H=\\pi/\\Gamma_2\\land\\vartheta:\\Gamma_2/\\Gamma_3\\xrightarrow{\\cong}\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}H\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{\\phi\\in\\pi^\\pi:\\mathrm{Aut}_S(\\phi,\\pi,\\cdot_\\pi)\\land\\forall x\\in\\pi\\;\\phi(x)\\Gamma_2=x\\Gamma_2\\right\\}\\land J\\in\\operatorname{Hom}\\!\\left(\\mathcal I,\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbb Z}\\!\\left(H,\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}H\\right)\\right)\\land\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall x\\in\\pi\\;J(\\phi)(x\\Gamma_2)=\\vartheta\\!\\left((\\phi(x)x^{-1})\\Gamma_3\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The formula records the first nontrivial action of a Torelli automorphism on the lower central series; the action on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\pi/\\Gamma_2\">\\(H=\\pi/\\Gamma_2\\)</span> itself is trivial.</li>\n<li>For a one-boundary surface, the image lies in the usual Johnson submodule of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}(H,\\bigwedge^2H)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}(H,\\bigwedge^2H)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb2bd3bd0214732","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"12045dd8fa450631","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"c9c5c2b9ecd4e85b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi_1:V^3\\to V$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-fundamental-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb2bd3bd0214732","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Aut}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"12045dd8fa450631","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-exterior-algebra.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g\\in\\omega\\land\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0,J,\\cdot_\\pi\\in V\\land x_0\\in\\partial\\Sigma_{g,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1:V^3\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aut}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JohnsonHom}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}johnson\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{JohnsonHom}_S(J,\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0,\\cdot_\\pi)\\leftrightarrow g\\geq2\\land x_0\\in\\partial\\Sigma_{g,1}\\land\\exists\\pi,H,\\Gamma_2,\\Gamma_3,\\mathcal I,\\vartheta\\;\\left(\\pi=\\pi_1(\\Sigma_{g,1},\\tau_\\Sigma,x_0)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(\\pi,\\cdot_\\pi)\\land\\Gamma_2=[\\pi,\\pi]\\land\\Gamma_3=[\\pi,\\Gamma_2]\\land H=\\pi/\\Gamma_2\\land\\vartheta:\\Gamma_2/\\Gamma_3\\xrightarrow{\\cong}\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}H\\land\\mathcal I=\\left\\{\\phi\\in\\pi^\\pi:\\mathrm{Aut}_S(\\phi,\\pi,\\cdot_\\pi)\\land\\forall x\\in\\pi\\;\\phi(x)\\Gamma_2=x\\Gamma_2\\right\\}\\land J\\in\\operatorname{Hom}\\!\\left(\\mathcal I,\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbb Z}\\!\\left(H,\\bigwedge_{\\mathbb Z}^{2}H\\right)\\right)\\land\\forall\\phi\\in\\mathcal I\\;\\forall x\\in\\pi\\;J(\\phi)(x\\Gamma_2)=\\vartheta\\!\\left((\\phi(x)x^{-1})\\Gamma_3\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"H=\\pi/\\Gamma_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}(H,\\bigwedge^2H)","display":false}],"bytes":2057,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anc